@*
    Phase H1 migration wrapper: the old fixed layout kept SelectionBar as persistent chrome
    above every tab, so FaderBank alone ("Select fixtures above to see their faders") only made
    sense next to it. Hosted standalone inside a Pane, FaderBank needs its own way to pick
    fixtures - so this composes the two existing, unmodified components together rather than
    changing either. This is the migrated "Channels" View for now; the real ownership-aware
    Channels View redesign (channel/level/selected/active/owner columns) is a later, separate
    step per the milestone's own sequencing.
*@
<div class="channels-view" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; height:100%; min-height:0">
    <SelectionBar />
    <div style="flex:1 1 auto; min-height:0; overflow:auto">
        <FaderBank />
    </div>
</div>
